@startuml
title Nimbus API: Document Purchase & Webhook Delivery Flow

participant "User/Client App" as App
participant "OAuth Server" as Auth
participant "Nimbus API" as API
participant "Webhook Endpoint" as Webhook

autonumber

== 1. Authentication (OAuth 2.0) ==
App -> Auth: Request Access Token (Auth Code / Refresh)
Auth --> App: Return Bearer Token (Expires 1h)

== 2. Document Selection & Purchase ==
App -> API: POST /check-availability (Title Number)
note right: Includes Bearer Token
API --> App: 200 OK (Document List + Costs)

App -> API: POST /purchase (Documents Select)
API --> App: 202 Accepted (Order ID)

== 3. Asynchronous Webhook Delivery ==
note over API, Webhook: Processing documents in background...
API -> Webhook: POST /delivery (Order ID + Download URLs)
note left: Includes X-Nimbus-Signature (HMAC)

activate Webhook
Webhook -> Webhook: Validate HMAC Signature
Webhook --> API: 200 OK (Ack)

== 4. Final Download ==
Webhook -> Webhook: Trigger Background Download
Webhook -> API: GET Document (Download URL)
API --> Webhook: Binary File Content
deactivate Webhook

@enduml